Description: Provides functions for estimating cross-validated R-squared
    in meta-regression models using precision-weighting schemes.
    Standard R-squared in meta-regression is optimistic, especially with
    few studies relative to moderators. This package implements leave-one-out
    cross-validation with optional precision weighting that accounts for
    the heteroscedasticity inherent in meta-analytic data.
